    "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />or <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math><br /><br />Therefore, tangential acceleration, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math><br /><br />or Tangential force,<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math><br /><br />Only tangential force does work.<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math>"
